WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.280 --> 01:43.986
=Episode 19=
(A Gift for 6-Year-Old Chen Luzhou)

01:48.479 --> 01:49.399
Stewed mutton?

01:49.399 --> 01:50.078
Okay, sure.

01:50.359 --> 01:51.198
Stewed mutton.

01:51.198 --> 01:52.198
Okay.

01:52.598 --> 01:53.158
Let me see.

01:53.518 --> 01:54.678
Smashed cucumbers.

01:55.558 --> 01:56.678
(Happy birthday, Luzhou!)

01:56.678 --> 01:57.639
Bean jelly.

01:57.639 --> 01:58.799
(You promised me.)

01:59.439 --> 02:00.238
(If I improve...)

02:00.238 --> 02:01.079
A pot of rice.

02:01.079 --> 02:02.439
(I'll go to Beijing to visit you.)

02:03.678 --> 02:05.718
- Then get us
- Lucy.

02:05.718 --> 02:06.759
four bottles of Coke.

02:06.759 --> 02:07.759
Coming.

02:08.198 --> 02:09.399
Limited edition hoodie.

02:11.038 --> 02:12.359
How's that? I love you, right?

02:12.359 --> 02:15.399
Alright, I will accept it then.

02:16.158 --> 02:17.518
Where's Zhi? Has she arrived?

02:18.038 --> 02:19.439
She will come over soon.

02:21.399 --> 02:22.399
What did you order?

02:22.718 --> 02:24.518
I ordered a snow crab.

02:24.879 --> 02:26.038
Okay. Let me see.

02:27.638 --> 02:28.638
Open-air food stall.

02:29.999 --> 02:30.960
Celebrating a birthday,

02:30.960 --> 02:32.598
why choose to eat here?

02:32.999 --> 02:34.118
Why?

02:34.638 --> 02:35.919
Why make it so grand?

02:36.399 --> 02:37.879
Don't distract her. Just a birthday.

02:38.479 --> 02:40.479
Alright, you are really considerate.

02:45.558 --> 02:46.558
Okay, thank you.

02:49.479 --> 02:50.479
Thanks.

02:51.319 --> 02:52.479
About what I said,

02:52.919 --> 02:53.919
you think about it.

02:55.678 --> 02:56.238
What is it?

02:56.518 --> 02:57.518
What?

02:58.439 --> 03:00.238
I want him
in the math modeling competition.

03:00.359 --> 03:01.759
But his current state

03:02.038 --> 03:03.038
is not that great.

03:03.399 --> 03:05.598
I think being in a relationship
has affected him a bit.

03:05.959 --> 03:06.959
Come on.

03:08.638 --> 03:09.919
How long does

03:11.078 --> 03:12.399
the passion phase last?

03:13.078 --> 03:14.118
Well...

03:14.479 --> 03:15.479
Three months?

03:15.999 --> 03:17.439
But it depends.

03:17.999 --> 03:18.999
He

03:19.439 --> 03:21.598
might take at least a year or two.

03:21.718 --> 03:22.718
That won't do.

03:22.919 --> 03:23.999
What a hopeless romantic.

03:24.198 --> 03:25.598
The competition will end then.

03:26.399 --> 03:27.479
Who told you I'm not going?

03:29.879 --> 03:31.399
Y-You'd be the witness that he agreed.

03:31.479 --> 03:32.038
You agreed.

03:32.479 --> 03:33.479
There you go.

03:34.439 --> 03:35.198
Let's do our best.

03:35.359 --> 03:36.319
In our sophomore year,

03:36.319 --> 03:37.319
these are all credits.

03:37.319 --> 03:38.319
You are all here.

03:38.558 --> 03:39.558
Happy birthday.

03:39.718 --> 03:40.718
You are here.

03:42.238 --> 03:43.238
That's it?

03:44.279 --> 03:45.999
You didn't bring anything
for my birthday?

03:46.118 --> 03:47.638
You told me not to prepare anything.

03:49.038 --> 03:50.038
Alright.

03:52.238 --> 03:53.238
What did you order?

03:53.319 --> 03:54.319
Here, take a look.

03:55.238 --> 03:57.279
W-We ordered the snow crab.

03:59.118 --> 04:00.118
Don't hide it.

04:00.678 --> 04:01.919
In the bag? Take it out.

04:02.238 --> 04:03.238
No, really.

04:03.399 --> 04:05.238
Boss, I want a can of cola.

04:05.238 --> 04:05.879
Really?

04:06.238 --> 04:07.238
Really.

04:09.919 --> 04:10.518
See?

04:10.518 --> 04:11.518
Thank you.

04:11.759 --> 04:13.238
Luzhou is acting melodramatic.

04:13.879 --> 04:15.038
What a hopeless romantic.

04:15.919 --> 04:16.678
I told you.

04:16.678 --> 04:17.678
Go buy me

04:18.238 --> 04:19.238
a basketball.

04:19.999 --> 04:20.999
Get a cheap one.

04:21.198 --> 04:22.558
No Spalding.

04:23.238 --> 04:25.198
So, if I ask you about this,

04:25.198 --> 04:26.638
you can throw the basketball at me.

04:35.598 --> 04:36.598
See?

04:36.999 --> 04:38.238
Nice.

04:39.118 --> 04:40.399
You got it.

04:47.959 --> 04:48.959
You're back.

04:53.799 --> 04:54.799
Where's the ball?

04:55.999 --> 04:57.879
I asked the owner
which ball doesn't hurt.

04:58.078 --> 05:00.038
He said only keychains don't hurt.

05:00.439 --> 05:01.759
You get angry so easily.

05:01.759 --> 05:02.839
This one would be safer.

05:09.359 --> 05:10.359
Alright then.

05:10.558 --> 05:11.919
This will be my birthday gift.

05:14.718 --> 05:15.718
Thank you.

05:21.759 --> 05:22.759
I'll have this one.

05:24.198 --> 05:26.319
It tastes good.
Try it, tender and flavorful.

05:26.319 --> 05:27.799
(Come with me to a place later.)

05:40.479 --> 05:41.718
(I have a gift for you.)

05:59.158 --> 06:00.799
See?

06:10.118 --> 06:11.118
It's sour.

06:11.399 --> 06:11.879
It's smelly.

06:12.038 --> 06:13.038
It's bitter.

06:20.638 --> 06:21.638
Excuse me.

06:23.879 --> 06:24.919
Enough, you eat.

06:24.919 --> 06:25.919
Enough?

06:27.399 --> 06:28.399
The last one.

06:32.479 --> 06:34.038
See. I am good to you.

06:34.759 --> 06:35.679
Every birthday boy

06:35.679 --> 06:36.759
has a birthday cake.

06:36.759 --> 06:37.759
Do I love you?

06:37.999 --> 06:38.999
Thank you, my son.

06:39.158 --> 06:40.718
You're the boss today. I'll let you go.

06:44.759 --> 06:45.759
Candle?

06:46.158 --> 06:47.119
No need.

06:47.119 --> 06:48.799
Don't do that. Let's get right to it.

06:49.078 --> 06:50.118
- Okay.
- Okay.

06:50.118 --> 06:51.118
Happy birthday!

06:51.439 --> 06:54.959
- ♪Happy birthday to you♪
- ♪Happy birthday to you♪

06:55.198 --> 06:58.759
- ♪Happy birthday to you♪
- ♪Happy birthday to you♪

06:58.959 --> 07:02.759
- ♪Happy birthday to you♪
- ♪Happy birthday to you♪

07:02.959 --> 07:06.078
- ♪Happy birthday to you♪
- ♪Happy birthday to you♪

07:06.319 --> 07:07.718
Alright, thank you.

07:08.184 --> 07:09.518
(MVP CHEN)

07:09.518 --> 07:10.558
- Come on.
- Come on.

07:10.558 --> 07:11.799
Get the beer.

07:12.799 --> 07:14.759
Shi Xiaosi and Shi Xiaoshi

07:14.999 --> 07:16.799
come to the reading room.

07:17.439 --> 07:20.078
Shi Xiaosi is 14 years old.

07:20.198 --> 07:22.839
And Shi Xiaoshi is 40 years old.

07:31.992 --> 07:34.104
(Broadcasting and Hosting)

07:37.439 --> 07:38.238
It's okay.

07:38.238 --> 07:39.038
You practice,

07:39.038 --> 07:40.479
and we'll be your audience.

07:43.238 --> 07:44.359
Okay.

07:46.279 --> 07:47.678
T-Then, I'll start.

07:48.959 --> 07:51.399
Welcome to today's program,

07:54.678 --> 07:55.839
Science World.

08:02.759 --> 08:05.279
Sorry. I'm not skilled.

08:05.359 --> 08:06.439
I'll give it back to you.

08:11.759 --> 08:12.759
Then you go ahead.

08:16.999 --> 08:18.559
Good evening, audience.

08:18.559 --> 08:20.679
This is the evening news live room.

08:20.999 --> 08:21.840
At any time,

08:21.840 --> 08:22.919
we always uphold

08:22.919 --> 08:25.358
the truthfulness
and objectivity of news,

08:25.599 --> 08:28.158
delivering the most valuable news
to you.

08:28.599 --> 08:30.118
I am the host, Zhou Lingyun.

08:30.318 --> 08:32.999
Here's the latest news
from around the world.

08:36.038 --> 08:37.759
(Zhu Yangqi)
(Someone held hands while eating crabs,)

08:37.879 --> 08:39.559
(while others
got their tongues stabbed.)

08:39.759 --> 08:40.879
(I won't tell who it is.)

08:40.879 --> 08:42.198
(When I get a girlfriend,)

08:42.198 --> 08:43.198
(I'll make you pay.)

08:46.158 --> 08:47.799
(Li Ke)
(Who can tell me how long)

08:47.799 --> 08:49.038
(the passion phase lasts?)

08:49.398 --> 08:51.519
(Waiting the answer here.)

08:52.999 --> 08:54.158
(Ask Zhi for me)

08:54.398 --> 08:56.238
(how to peel crabs while holding hands.)

08:58.118 --> 09:00.559
(Xu Zhi)
(With mouth, a secret technique.)

09:04.639 --> 09:05.679
Anyone wants to practice?

09:12.679 --> 09:13.679
What?

09:14.639 --> 09:15.839
You'll know.

09:17.839 --> 09:19.919
This is the gift you prepared for me?

09:22.158 --> 09:23.158
Nice.

09:23.679 --> 09:24.078
Thanks.

09:24.318 --> 09:25.318
Take a seat.

09:25.478 --> 09:26.478
Why?

09:28.959 --> 09:29.959
Just sit.

09:30.398 --> 09:31.398
Alright then.

09:31.799 --> 09:33.438
Then what? More surprise?

09:33.438 --> 09:34.438
Then wait a moment.

09:41.038 --> 09:44.078
♪Happy birthday to you♪

09:44.318 --> 09:47.318
♪Happy birthday to you♪

09:47.559 --> 09:50.398
♪Happy birthday to you♪

09:53.158 --> 09:54.238
♪Happy birthday♪

09:57.118 --> 09:58.118
This is for you.

10:18.839 --> 10:19.839
It's snowing.

10:20.318 --> 10:21.318
It really is snowing.

10:22.639 --> 10:24.118
Come on. Really nice.

10:50.398 --> 10:51.559
Hey, Zhi.

10:51.919 --> 10:53.799
Get distracted
when hugging your boyfriend.

10:55.999 --> 10:56.999
You haven't made a wish.

10:59.078 --> 11:00.078
Make a wish now.

11:00.158 --> 11:01.158
Okay.

11:11.759 --> 11:12.599
Wait a moment.

11:12.759 --> 11:13.520
More?

11:13.520 --> 11:14.599
Of course.

11:21.438 --> 11:23.478
This is for you, little Chen Luzhou.

11:27.438 --> 11:28.438
Take a look.

11:33.752 --> 11:35.078
(It's more than just a birthday.)

11:35.078 --> 11:36.719
(The 19-year-old Chen Luzhou)

11:36.719 --> 11:38.679
(has the 19-year-old Xu Zhi
by his side.)

11:40.238 --> 11:41.799
(A gift)

11:41.799 --> 11:43.599
(for 6-year-old Chen Luzhou.)

11:47.384 --> 11:53.277
♪How many sceneries have I passed by♪

11:54.200 --> 11:55.719
♪Waiting for a meeting♪

11:55.719 --> 11:57.639
If you have nowhere to go in Qingyi,

11:57.999 --> 11:59.999
we can build our own home.

12:00.568 --> 12:03.128
♪The heartbeat reminds♪

12:03.128 --> 12:06.438
♪The moment I hug you♪

12:06.438 --> 12:09.080
Chen Luzhou, happy birthday!

12:09.080 --> 12:14.197
♪Let every chapter of the story align♪

12:16.216 --> 12:19.488
♪Even if it rains on you♪

12:19.799 --> 12:20.799
How long did you make it?

12:21.398 --> 12:22.398
Do you like it?

12:22.919 --> 12:23.919
How long?

12:24.280 --> 12:25.999
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

12:25.999 --> 12:27.519
I'll ask your roommate then.

12:27.919 --> 12:28.919
Alright.

12:29.038 --> 12:30.799
Just stayed up a few nights.

12:31.438 --> 12:33.719
Don't cry. It's quite simple.

12:33.719 --> 12:36.997
♪I will always be with you♪

12:37.944 --> 12:40.941
♪I will let you know♪

12:41.368 --> 12:44.344
♪You're the only one♪

12:44.888 --> 12:47.869
♪When the rain blurs the world♪

12:48.376 --> 12:51.223
♪Parallel distance♪

12:52.664 --> 12:53.318
♪With you♪

12:53.318 --> 12:54.599
Do you think

12:55.278 --> 12:56.879
that I'm attracted by your looks?

12:59.519 --> 13:01.158
But I am really serious about

13:01.158 --> 13:02.358
dating you.

13:04.792 --> 13:07.478
♪Even if it rains on you♪

13:07.478 --> 13:09.679
Stop crying, Shy Boy Chen.

13:09.679 --> 13:11.839
♪I will always be with you♪

13:11.839 --> 13:12.959
Let's cut the cake.

13:12.959 --> 13:13.959
Okay.

13:16.152 --> 13:17.238
♪Our love will last♪

13:17.238 --> 13:18.799
The birthday boy cuts first.

13:19.318 --> 13:20.158
Make a cut.

13:20.238 --> 13:21.238
Okay.

13:21.679 --> 13:22.679
Where should I start?

13:22.679 --> 13:25.804
♪I will always be with you♪

13:26.776 --> 13:29.655
♪I will let you know♪

13:30.478 --> 13:30.959
By the way,

13:31.478 --> 13:32.999
any plans for winter vacation?

13:33.438 --> 13:35.318
I heard our department

13:35.679 --> 13:37.278
will have two weeks after the final exam

13:37.278 --> 13:38.278
to go out for sketching.

13:38.679 --> 13:39.919
Draw Bai-style architecture.

13:40.118 --> 13:42.278
We might get our vacation
two weeks later than you.

13:42.559 --> 13:43.919
Are you heading to Qingyi first?

13:44.358 --> 13:45.358
Probably not.

13:45.959 --> 13:47.919
The competition happens
to be during that period.

13:48.158 --> 13:49.158
I might not get back.

13:49.959 --> 13:51.238
Then I won't go back either.

13:52.478 --> 13:53.478
Come on.

13:53.999 --> 13:55.038
Won't your dad scold you?

13:57.118 --> 13:58.719
So you'll be alone for Chinese New Year.

13:58.879 --> 14:00.398
So what? Li Ke will be with me.

14:03.198 --> 14:04.599
Who is Li Ke to you?

14:05.158 --> 14:06.839
You guys are really close.

14:07.438 --> 14:09.398
You are funny.

14:10.158 --> 14:11.839
You are not jealous of others,

14:12.519 --> 14:14.238
except Li Ke.

14:15.919 --> 14:17.038
Tell me,

14:18.639 --> 14:20.358
am I prettier or is Li Ke?

14:20.839 --> 14:21.839
What?

14:23.478 --> 14:24.519
Don't worry.

14:25.278 --> 14:26.999
Wang Yue
from the department of computing.

14:27.438 --> 14:28.438
We three

14:29.278 --> 14:30.278
take the competition.

14:35.959 --> 14:36.479
Hey, you!

14:36.479 --> 14:37.639
Is Li Ke or...

14:38.038 --> 14:39.519
Is Li Ke prettier or Wang Yue?

14:39.879 --> 14:40.959
If I fell into the water

14:40.959 --> 14:41.960
with your dad,

14:41.960 --> 14:43.278
who would you save first?

14:47.438 --> 14:48.799
Well...

14:50.038 --> 14:51.038
My dad.

14:55.318 --> 14:56.398
Hey, Dad.

14:56.879 --> 14:57.879
What are you doing?

14:58.679 --> 14:59.799
You're still up so late.

15:00.679 --> 15:02.158
I'm doing homework.

15:04.478 --> 15:06.038
A lot of homework lately?

15:06.398 --> 15:08.438
You haven't called me for a long time.

15:09.038 --> 15:11.559
I heard it's snowing in Beijing tonight.

15:12.719 --> 15:13.600
Yes.

15:13.600 --> 15:15.398
I could make a snowman tomorrow.

15:17.759 --> 15:19.799
First winter in Beijing,

15:19.799 --> 15:20.959
you need to keep warm.

15:21.278 --> 15:23.398
Okay, we have heating here.

15:23.679 --> 15:25.278
Don't worry. I won't freeze.

15:26.398 --> 15:27.919
Got the thermal pants, right?

15:28.639 --> 15:29.999
Yes.

15:30.839 --> 15:32.839
It made Cai extremely jealous.

15:36.318 --> 15:37.639
Half the semester is over,

15:38.478 --> 15:40.559
any desirable boys appeared?

15:45.759 --> 15:46.759
No.

15:47.158 --> 15:48.358
I am busy doing homework.

15:50.198 --> 15:52.519
Are you still thinking
about Chen Luzhou?

15:52.679 --> 15:54.198
Why would I?

15:54.198 --> 15:55.879
We haven't been in touch at all.

15:56.639 --> 15:57.639
Okay.

15:57.919 --> 15:58.919
It's good then.

16:00.559 --> 16:01.559
It's late.

16:01.799 --> 16:03.679
Go to bed after finishing your homework.

16:04.318 --> 16:05.719
Okay, bye-bye.

16:10.438 --> 16:11.959
We haven't been in touch at all?

16:13.599 --> 16:16.078
You are such a liar now.

16:16.078 --> 16:17.118
I was before too.

16:18.038 --> 16:18.720
You are

16:18.720 --> 16:20.238
so good at lying.

16:20.238 --> 16:21.639
If you cheat on me,

16:21.639 --> 16:22.519
I wouldn't even know.

16:22.519 --> 16:23.519
Impossible.

16:23.799 --> 16:25.038
If I cheat on you,

16:25.198 --> 16:27.118
I surely won't keep you in the dark.

16:29.478 --> 16:31.438
I will bury you in the ground.

16:39.198 --> 16:40.679
How ruthless.

17:09.799 --> 17:11.158
I heard from Zhao Tianqi

17:11.158 --> 17:12.879
Luzhou entered
a math modeling competition.

17:13.999 --> 17:15.398
Usually, only sophomores

17:15.398 --> 17:17.078
participate in this competition.

17:18.118 --> 17:19.278
They did it as freshmen.

17:19.278 --> 17:20.278
Impressive.

17:21.318 --> 17:22.358
Not really.

17:22.358 --> 17:23.278
He got 96 in calculus.

17:23.278 --> 17:24.278
Xu Zhi scored 100.

17:24.559 --> 17:26.559
Xu Zhi is a bit more impressive.

17:27.398 --> 17:28.038
Right.

17:28.198 --> 17:29.839
Alright, class begins.

17:29.839 --> 17:30.839
The teacher is here.

17:32.344 --> 17:34.429
(Architectural Design)

17:35.038 --> 17:37.038
Three students have to redo

17:37.038 --> 17:39.238
their design hand-drawings
from last time.

17:40.278 --> 17:41.398
I hope I'm not included.

17:41.398 --> 17:42.759
These three students are...

17:43.799 --> 17:45.679
Don't say my name.

17:45.759 --> 17:46.759
Xu Yumo,

17:50.038 --> 17:51.038
Ma Yuting,

17:55.919 --> 17:56.919
and Xu Zhi.

18:05.238 --> 18:06.478
What's going on?

18:06.959 --> 18:08.038
There must be a mistake.

18:08.038 --> 18:09.839
All our drawings
were under her guidance.

18:13.038 --> 18:14.358
These three students,

18:15.398 --> 18:16.398
redraw it

18:16.919 --> 18:18.559
and submit it to me next week.

18:20.358 --> 18:21.398
Alright, students.

18:21.398 --> 18:23.639
Turn to page 61 of your textbook.

18:24.559 --> 18:26.358
Today I'll be talking about

18:27.639 --> 18:28.919
architectural structure.

18:30.639 --> 18:32.639
Before it,

18:33.799 --> 18:35.278
I will first talk about

18:35.719 --> 18:38.559
the components of architecture.

18:39.719 --> 18:40.319
Are you okay?

18:40.319 --> 18:43.799
And the core principles.

18:48.719 --> 18:49.759
Alright.

18:49.759 --> 18:50.999
That's it for today.

18:51.278 --> 18:52.599
Class dismissed.

18:53.198 --> 18:54.959
Thank you, Sir.

18:59.038 --> 19:00.038
What do you want to eat?

19:01.839 --> 19:02.488
Let's go.

19:02.488 --> 19:03.599
Let's go.

19:04.078 --> 19:05.078
It seems today

19:05.318 --> 19:06.599
you can't have lunch with us.

19:14.999 --> 19:15.999
What do you want to eat?

19:16.639 --> 19:18.478
The first canteen got a new malatang.

19:20.038 --> 19:21.438
You go eat by yourself.

19:24.719 --> 19:25.959
I'm not that hungry.

19:26.559 --> 19:27.879
I'm going to the library.

19:33.839 --> 19:34.919
What's wrong with her?

19:34.919 --> 19:35.478
Her

19:35.879 --> 19:37.158
design hand-drawing assignment

19:37.158 --> 19:38.559
got rejected by Mr. Hu.

19:38.879 --> 19:40.999
And both of our assignments
were under her guidance,

19:41.278 --> 19:42.278
and we both passed.

19:43.278 --> 19:44.278
Go check on her.

19:45.559 --> 19:46.559
Thanks.

20:22.318 --> 20:23.719
You need to eat well to work.

21:15.288 --> 21:16.358
Are you tired?

21:18.919 --> 21:20.158
I lost to you in the midterms.

21:20.919 --> 21:21.959
How to punish me?

21:24.719 --> 21:25.839
Just owe me once.

21:27.478 --> 21:28.078
How about this?

21:28.478 --> 21:29.478
Just punish me

21:29.999 --> 21:31.358
accompany you for a walk,

21:32.318 --> 21:33.318
okay?

21:35.679 --> 21:36.839
Alright, let's go.

21:38.158 --> 21:39.158
Draw later.

21:47.416 --> 21:51.708
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

21:53.816 --> 21:59.408
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

21:59.639 --> 22:00.639
I fell down.

22:00.952 --> 22:05.330
♪The world is too quiet♪

22:06.999 --> 22:08.839
When people fall down,

22:09.919 --> 22:10.919
they would lie down.

22:11.398 --> 22:13.198
Take a break and catch a breath.

22:13.880 --> 22:17.559
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

22:17.559 --> 22:18.559
How about it, Zhi?

22:19.799 --> 22:20.799
Sit with me for a while

22:20.799 --> 22:21.799
and catch a breath.

22:26.904 --> 22:29.208
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

22:30.328 --> 22:36.780
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

22:36.888 --> 22:39.814
♪The lonely clock♪

22:40.280 --> 22:44.294
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

22:45.240 --> 22:48.712
♪Are we both♪

22:48.856 --> 22:52.079
♪Attracted to each other♪

22:52.999 --> 22:54.318
You might not believe it.

22:56.478 --> 22:58.719
The first time I felt inferior was

22:58.719 --> 23:00.318
the day I helped you check your scores.

23:03.318 --> 23:04.639
My school is a city standout.

23:05.158 --> 23:06.879
It has the best students in the Qingyi.

23:07.679 --> 23:08.799
Everyone studied hard.

23:09.238 --> 23:10.879
And I improved my grades

23:10.879 --> 23:11.919
in there.

23:12.679 --> 23:13.719
But Ruijun is different.

23:15.438 --> 23:17.358
It's easy to go with the flow.

23:17.959 --> 23:19.318
When I checked your scores,

23:19.318 --> 23:20.318
I was thinking,

23:20.639 --> 23:21.759
if I were in Ruijun School,

23:21.759 --> 23:23.038
I'd never get grades like yours.

23:24.078 --> 23:25.438
You don't have to comfort me.

23:25.719 --> 23:26.799
I'm not comforting you.

23:27.478 --> 23:28.478
It's true.

23:30.559 --> 23:32.599
I think you might not be fully aware

23:32.599 --> 23:33.999
of your excellence.

23:39.719 --> 23:40.719
So,

23:43.118 --> 23:45.398
just maintain a calm mindset.

23:45.679 --> 23:46.959
Find the root of the problem.

23:47.519 --> 23:48.199
And then,

23:48.199 --> 23:49.318
go all out and overcome it.

23:50.318 --> 23:51.919
I believe you can do

23:51.919 --> 23:53.599
whatever you want.

23:53.720 --> 23:57.712
♪From reaching eternity♪

23:58.424 --> 24:01.767
♪After rushing recklessly♪

24:02.087 --> 24:04.559
♪We approach each other♪

24:04.559 --> 24:05.559
What's wrong?

24:08.238 --> 24:09.719
Sorry. Missed it.

24:09.919 --> 24:10.919
Are you okay?

24:11.599 --> 24:13.679
Xu Zhi, are you okay?

24:14.438 --> 24:15.438
It's okay.

24:15.959 --> 24:17.438
Just in time. Come over here.

24:17.438 --> 24:18.478
I want to chat with you.

24:18.679 --> 24:19.318
About what?

24:19.559 --> 24:20.520
Come over here.

24:20.520 --> 24:22.278
About the math modeling competition.

24:27.679 --> 24:28.679
Hey!

24:29.158 --> 24:31.158
This is too big.

24:31.519 --> 24:33.358
Slow down.
Or she can't catch up with you.

24:37.078 --> 24:38.238
Are you okay?

24:38.358 --> 24:40.118
I'm fine.

24:40.438 --> 24:41.478
I've warned you.

24:43.278 --> 24:44.478
What's wrong with you?

24:45.679 --> 24:46.679
Now.

24:47.278 --> 24:48.198
What are you doing?

24:48.198 --> 24:49.078
Why?

24:49.078 --> 24:51.478
You call him Ke yet call me Xu Zhi.

24:51.679 --> 24:53.438
Li Ke, I'm here to save you.

24:53.519 --> 24:54.519
Zhao Tianqi.

24:54.519 --> 24:57.748
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

24:57.748 --> 25:01.253
♪Only passionate love
like a ray of sunshine♪

25:01.656 --> 25:03.640
♪Can beat the night♪

25:03.832 --> 25:07.757
♪We can outrun time♪

25:07.960 --> 25:11.445
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

25:11.445 --> 25:14.078
♪All blend into our season♪

25:14.078 --> 25:16.358
(The essence of youth)

25:16.519 --> 25:18.078
(lies in)

25:18.078 --> 25:19.799
(their inspiring initiative.)

25:20.959 --> 25:23.999
(It's better to take action
than just talk.)

25:23.999 --> 25:25.719
(Do it once you think of it.)

25:26.238 --> 25:28.559
(No matter how difficult,
never give up.)

25:28.879 --> 25:30.599
(They are idealistic)

25:30.599 --> 25:33.078
(and the ones seizing the day.)

25:33.519 --> 25:34.959
(They are all such people,)

25:35.438 --> 25:37.519
(and so should I.)

25:38.680 --> 25:42.040
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

25:42.520 --> 25:45.880
♪All blend into our season♪

25:45.880 --> 25:47.448
(Architecture Department Office)

25:51.999 --> 25:52.639
Professor,

25:52.759 --> 25:54.158
I tried drawing a few more drafts,

25:54.278 --> 25:56.038
yet I can't make it right.

25:56.198 --> 25:57.478
I would like to ask

25:57.599 --> 25:59.759
what the problem is with my design.

26:15.759 --> 26:17.519
Your drawings are accurate,

26:18.078 --> 26:19.519
especially about spatial awareness.

26:20.398 --> 26:23.158
You are among the best of the freshmen,

26:23.639 --> 26:25.799
so my expectations of you are higher.

26:26.639 --> 26:27.639
This assignment

26:27.759 --> 26:29.358
is to construct a small urban park

26:29.358 --> 26:30.839
for a village in the city.

26:31.919 --> 26:34.959
Your work is meticulous enough,

26:35.478 --> 26:36.478
but

26:37.599 --> 26:39.438
lacking a bit of spirit.

26:40.038 --> 26:41.198
The spirit

26:42.198 --> 26:45.158
refers mainly to the humanistic emotion.

26:51.318 --> 26:53.879
This is the previous excellent work.

26:54.999 --> 26:56.238
You can compare it

26:56.759 --> 26:58.959
and understand what the difference is.

27:06.599 --> 27:07.639
Thank you, Professor.

28:02.599 --> 28:03.599
Xu Zhi.

28:08.318 --> 28:09.318
Mom.

28:10.599 --> 28:11.919
Don't waste your time.

28:13.599 --> 28:15.639
You are not suited to be an architect.

28:17.519 --> 28:18.519
To be honest,

28:19.559 --> 28:21.238
you have no talent in this.

28:23.519 --> 28:25.719
Do you have to speak so harshly?

28:29.799 --> 28:30.799
Feeling upset?

28:32.198 --> 28:33.198
Don't you accept it?

28:37.719 --> 28:39.078
Then cry it out.

28:51.919 --> 28:52.959
Look at you.

28:54.559 --> 28:55.799
You can't even cry.

28:56.919 --> 28:58.398
What else can you accomplish?

28:59.198 --> 29:00.519
You were such a crybaby

29:01.879 --> 29:03.679
back then.

29:05.639 --> 29:07.519
You would cry if you couldn't get candy.

29:09.238 --> 29:10.919
When the flowers you grew died,

29:12.879 --> 29:14.038
you would cry too.

29:20.038 --> 29:21.038
Think about it.

29:23.118 --> 29:24.959
How long has it been
since you last cried out?

29:28.999 --> 29:29.999
Xu Zhi,

29:31.679 --> 29:33.038
if this is what you chose,

29:35.118 --> 29:36.478
then go forward.

29:40.398 --> 29:42.919
Look ahead. Don't look back.

29:47.448 --> 29:47.992
Mom.

30:03.519 --> 30:04.519
Xu Gongzhu.

30:05.158 --> 30:07.078
You set the alarm wrong again.

30:08.640 --> 30:10.944
(Time's up)

30:13.198 --> 30:14.519
Xu Gongzhu!

30:19.398 --> 30:20.398
Zhu!

30:21.198 --> 30:22.198
Alarm.

30:30.078 --> 30:31.078
Sorry.

30:31.559 --> 30:33.398
Sorry.

30:33.398 --> 30:34.679
I remembered it wrong again.

30:36.559 --> 30:38.759
I swear this is the last time.

30:49.999 --> 30:50.999
Handsome.

30:51.919 --> 30:53.118
You look a bit familiar.

30:53.118 --> 30:54.398
Do you work out around here?

30:54.999 --> 30:56.078
I stopped working out.

30:56.519 --> 30:57.519
Why?

30:58.438 --> 30:59.639
We can go work out together.

30:59.879 --> 31:01.639
Maybe I can even teach you.

31:02.398 --> 31:03.839
No need. It's not appropriate.

31:04.679 --> 31:05.679
Don't be shy.

31:06.078 --> 31:07.398
Maybe exchange WeChat contacts?

31:08.519 --> 31:09.599
WeChat...

31:09.799 --> 31:10.919
It's not appropriate.

31:10.919 --> 31:11.919
Come on.

31:12.278 --> 31:14.999
Sorry, I'm late.

31:18.999 --> 31:19.520
Sorry,

31:19.520 --> 31:21.272
I didn't know you had a girlfriend.

31:22.318 --> 31:23.039
She is not...

31:23.039 --> 31:25.398
It's okay. Not too late to know now.

31:26.478 --> 31:27.759
Then I won't disturb you.

31:35.559 --> 31:37.478
Come on, Zhu.
What are you treating me to?

31:39.478 --> 31:41.398
Whatever you like, I am treating.

31:41.839 --> 31:43.599
Whatever I like? Really?

31:44.478 --> 31:45.799
Waiter, I'd like to order.

31:47.358 --> 31:48.599
- This one is good.
- I want this.

31:49.358 --> 31:51.038
Since we are participating,

31:51.478 --> 31:53.238
we are aiming
for the scholarship, right?

31:53.238 --> 31:53.679
Yes.

31:53.999 --> 31:56.519
Professor Liu
has experience and resources.

31:56.519 --> 31:58.198
And he has led
several championship teams.

31:58.438 --> 31:59.319
For us,

31:59.319 --> 32:00.478
he is the best option.

32:00.799 --> 32:01.999
Wait. You know.

32:02.198 --> 32:03.478
There are only a few professors

32:03.478 --> 32:04.478
as competition mentors.

32:04.759 --> 32:06.238
Professor Liu is so famous.

32:06.238 --> 32:07.559
He must lead a lot of people.

32:07.719 --> 32:08.839
Last time I heard

32:08.839 --> 32:10.158
he is leading over 40 teams.

32:10.318 --> 32:11.839
Can he manage so many people?

32:12.198 --> 32:13.759
Mr. Bai is different.

32:13.959 --> 32:15.879
He is very responsible
for every student.

32:16.158 --> 32:17.158
Indeed,

32:17.559 --> 32:19.198
but he's not even a full professor.

32:19.519 --> 32:20.599
For us,

32:20.599 --> 32:21.959
there's no real advantage.

32:21.959 --> 32:23.759
Ke, you don't understand.

32:23.759 --> 32:24.438
Listen

32:24.599 --> 32:26.158
more about Mr. Bai.

32:26.639 --> 32:28.158
He is indifferent to fame and fortune,

32:28.999 --> 32:31.759
but that doesn't mean
he's less capable than others.

32:32.959 --> 32:33.959
Luzhou.

32:34.879 --> 32:35.879
Luzhou.

32:37.559 --> 32:38.559
Luzhou.

32:40.078 --> 32:41.398
Tell us who you choose.

32:41.999 --> 32:42.519
What?

32:42.719 --> 32:43.759
Our mentor.

32:43.999 --> 32:45.278
Between Liu Ming and Bai Jiang,

32:45.959 --> 32:46.959
choose one.

32:48.398 --> 32:51.038
(Chen Luzhou, can you make me cry?)

32:54.438 --> 32:55.639
(I had a nightmare.)

32:55.639 --> 32:57.839
(Want to cry, but can't.)

32:57.839 --> 32:58.839
(Where are you?)

32:59.478 --> 33:00.839
(Downstairs of your dorm.)

33:02.919 --> 33:03.959
I'm going out.

33:03.959 --> 33:04.959
Where are you going?

33:06.999 --> 33:08.038
Xu Zhi had a nightmare.

33:08.038 --> 33:09.038
I'll go comfort her.

33:10.438 --> 33:11.639
Take a coat.

33:12.759 --> 33:13.759
He...

33:15.759 --> 33:16.759
I-It's okay.

33:16.839 --> 33:18.158
Except spoiling his girlfriend,

33:18.158 --> 33:19.158
he's fine.

33:21.719 --> 33:22.719
Quite nice.

33:22.999 --> 33:24.078
A good boyfriend.

33:24.398 --> 33:25.559
I need to learn from him.

33:27.438 --> 33:29.278
What? You bachelor.

33:29.679 --> 33:30.679
Who's the bachelor?

33:31.318 --> 33:31.839
You...

33:32.318 --> 33:33.398
You are not a bachelor?

33:33.559 --> 33:34.559
I have a girlfriend.

33:34.639 --> 33:35.719
Just after high school.

33:36.118 --> 33:37.478
She's at Qingyi University.

33:40.679 --> 33:42.318
What? You didn't ask me.

33:48.038 --> 33:49.519
Fine.

33:51.398 --> 33:52.919
So I'm the only bachelor here?

33:54.879 --> 33:56.438
I think so.

34:24.679 --> 34:26.198
I dreamed of my mom again.

34:26.759 --> 34:28.358
She said
I'm not suited for architecture.

34:29.118 --> 34:32.278
She told me that I have no talent,
and couldn't even cry.

34:33.118 --> 34:35.559
Dreams are all opposite. Don't mind it.

34:37.919 --> 34:39.559
But Professor Hu said the same thing.

34:40.478 --> 34:42.639
He said my designs are accurate,

34:42.919 --> 34:44.519
but lacking a bit of spirit.

34:47.078 --> 34:48.919
I can probably understand
why he said that.

34:51.919 --> 34:52.999
I've known you for so long,

34:52.999 --> 34:54.438
yet you have never been angry.

34:55.358 --> 34:56.519
Even when we argued,

34:56.719 --> 34:58.038
you left without saying anything.

35:00.438 --> 35:02.078
What does this
have to do with my design?

35:04.599 --> 35:06.398
I thought that a designer's inspiration

35:07.078 --> 35:09.559
comes from capturing
and conveying emotions.

35:11.078 --> 35:12.198
At this time,

35:12.198 --> 35:13.199
sentimental people

35:13.199 --> 35:14.679
have an advantage,

35:14.679 --> 35:16.438
which is the spirit.

35:17.278 --> 35:19.438
But you seem to be accustomed to

35:19.438 --> 35:20.839
suppressing your emotions.

35:25.438 --> 35:27.398
Maybe it has something
to do with my mom.

35:28.158 --> 35:30.559
My mom is
a particularly excellent architect.

35:30.719 --> 35:31.839
She is very strong-willed,

35:32.038 --> 35:33.038
and domineering at home.

35:33.358 --> 35:34.759
She treated me harshly,

35:34.999 --> 35:36.358
but was soft-hearted to others.

35:36.839 --> 35:38.038
Later, she died,

35:38.198 --> 35:39.639
leaving a big mess behind

35:39.639 --> 35:41.198
for my dad and I.

35:42.438 --> 35:43.919
You probably can't imagine that.

35:44.278 --> 35:46.719
Someone once brought a child
to my dad for upbringing.

35:47.238 --> 35:49.839
She said after my mom died,

35:50.078 --> 35:51.719
all engineering projects have stopped.

35:52.038 --> 35:53.639
Nobody's paying them wages.

35:53.759 --> 35:55.519
There's no money for baby formula.

35:56.799 --> 35:58.198
Before my mom died,

35:58.198 --> 35:59.438
she thought they were pitiful

35:59.639 --> 36:00.959
and helped them a few times.

36:01.358 --> 36:02.719
At that time, I felt

36:03.078 --> 36:04.759
that emotions
are the most useless things.

36:05.238 --> 36:06.398
Without emotions,

36:07.118 --> 36:08.478
there's no empathy

36:08.879 --> 36:10.559
or troubles.

36:15.038 --> 36:16.679
No wonder when Tan Xu failed the exam,

36:16.679 --> 36:17.679
you would say that.

36:18.759 --> 36:19.919
But do you realize

36:19.919 --> 36:22.278
that you don't get to the point
many times?

36:22.959 --> 36:23.959
Is that so?

36:24.358 --> 36:26.038
It hurts others more.

36:27.959 --> 36:29.278
So stop

36:29.278 --> 36:31.438
suppressing your emotions anymore,

36:31.959 --> 36:33.839
even making the people around you
do the same.

36:34.078 --> 36:35.238
Over time,

36:35.238 --> 36:36.438
your perception

36:37.078 --> 36:39.118
and empathy will weaken.

36:40.238 --> 36:41.238
Is that so?

36:42.599 --> 36:43.599
Anyway,

36:44.118 --> 36:45.118
Zhi,

36:46.238 --> 36:47.358
it's good you want to cry.

36:48.438 --> 36:49.839
Just let your emotions out.

36:50.438 --> 36:51.438
Don't hold them in.

36:55.198 --> 36:56.679
Then help me out.

36:56.959 --> 36:59.198
Okay. Any method?

37:01.679 --> 37:02.679
Then I'll do it.

37:03.679 --> 37:05.038
What? No way.

37:05.038 --> 37:05.960
I'll beat you to tears.

37:05.960 --> 37:07.238
Doesn't it count?

37:08.438 --> 37:09.639
Just don't complain about it.

37:14.238 --> 37:15.238
Okay?

37:15.919 --> 37:16.919
Do you think it's okay?

37:16.999 --> 37:18.759
I'd rather beat you up.

37:19.839 --> 37:20.919
What are you doing?

37:22.038 --> 37:23.438
Okay. It's fine.

37:24.639 --> 37:25.919
Give me a hug.

37:29.799 --> 37:30.799
Come on.

37:44.879 --> 37:45.879
Let's go.

37:47.358 --> 37:48.919
I'm energetic now.

37:50.358 --> 37:51.159
I can beat you now.

37:51.159 --> 37:52.919
It's an honor to make you energetic.

37:57.679 --> 37:58.919
Seriously?

37:59.799 --> 38:01.278
I'm the one being harassed.

38:01.278 --> 38:02.328
What's wrong with you?

38:03.078 --> 38:04.398
It's all your fault

38:04.398 --> 38:05.759
for dressing too flamboyantly,

38:05.759 --> 38:06.720
not decent at all.

38:06.720 --> 38:08.078
Or you can't be that attractive.

38:08.078 --> 38:09.198
You troublemaker.

38:10.078 --> 38:12.559
Isn't this normal attire?

38:18.158 --> 38:19.158
Well...

38:19.559 --> 38:20.959
You quite minded pretending

38:20.959 --> 38:22.358
to be a couple with me.

38:22.959 --> 38:24.799
Why...?

38:26.038 --> 38:28.038
I saw you were in embarrassment,

38:28.038 --> 38:29.118
so I helped you out.

38:29.118 --> 38:30.118
Don't overthink it.

38:33.679 --> 38:34.560
Did I

38:34.560 --> 38:36.038
ruin your plans?

38:36.639 --> 38:39.078
You can't resist pretty girls.

38:39.078 --> 38:40.599
What?

38:41.158 --> 38:43.358
Next time. I'll just tell her directly

38:43.799 --> 38:44.478
that...

38:44.478 --> 38:45.478
What?

38:46.078 --> 38:47.719
I already have a crush.

38:51.438 --> 38:52.799
At the gate of your school,

38:52.799 --> 38:54.759
I saw the promotion
of freshman art exhibition.

38:54.759 --> 38:55.759
Will you participate?

38:58.118 --> 39:00.038
What for?

39:00.238 --> 39:02.519
I'm already at the next level.

39:02.759 --> 39:04.118
I would only participate in

39:04.118 --> 39:05.158
the school art exhibition.

39:06.478 --> 39:07.959
I'll come to support you then.

39:08.519 --> 39:09.559
No need.

39:10.038 --> 39:11.398
It's troublesome for you to come.

39:11.398 --> 39:13.358
It's okay. I can take a day off.

39:14.118 --> 39:15.118
Wait...

39:26.278 --> 39:27.278
Let's stop here.

39:28.278 --> 39:28.999
Go to bed early.

39:28.999 --> 39:29.999
Goodnight.

39:30.398 --> 39:31.398
By the way,

39:32.358 --> 39:33.559
when are you free next week?

39:33.559 --> 39:34.559
What's wrong?

39:35.198 --> 39:36.198
You forgot it?

39:37.759 --> 39:38.959
You asked me to make you cry.

39:46.599 --> 39:47.599
Go to bed early.

41:31.318 --> 41:33.358
Shy Boy Chen, what's wrong with you?

41:35.599 --> 41:36.839
Why are you crying?

41:39.398 --> 41:41.118
I only brought one pack of tissues.

41:41.118 --> 41:42.118
If you use it up,

41:42.519 --> 41:43.679
there's no more for you.

41:44.158 --> 41:45.398
Stop crying.

41:50.038 --> 41:52.478
Fake. It's all acting.

41:56.318 --> 41:58.278
Xu Zhi, you really don't know
how to comfort me.

42:01.679 --> 42:03.358
We all know the film is fake,

42:05.038 --> 42:06.599
but we all believe

42:06.999 --> 42:08.719
Mr. Ba's love is real, right?

42:09.118 --> 42:10.799
Yes. I'm sorry.

42:15.478 --> 42:16.719
Use a new one.

42:18.919 --> 42:19.919
Before,

42:20.759 --> 42:22.999
Zhu Yangqi recommended this film
to me many times,

42:23.679 --> 42:25.639
saying he and Feng Jin tear up
every single time.

42:25.639 --> 42:26.839
So I didn't dare to watch it.

42:28.999 --> 42:30.759
He even kept a dog because of this film,

42:30.759 --> 42:31.720
and named it Mr. Qi.

42:31.720 --> 42:33.198
But he got beaten by his dad.

42:34.438 --> 42:36.318
Because his great-grandfather
has the same name.

42:44.568 --> 42:47.896
(Film Review)
(It is based on a true story.)

42:49.318 --> 42:50.318
Shy Boy Chen.

42:51.919 --> 42:52.999
I was wrong.

42:53.438 --> 42:55.438
This is based on a true story.

43:09.398 --> 43:12.238
If you keep crying, the staff will see

43:12.238 --> 43:14.358
and think I did something to you.

43:45.176 --> 43:47.544
(The essence of youth)

43:47.544 --> 43:49.880
(lies in their inspiring initiative.)

43:50.008 --> 43:51.864
(It's better to take action
than just talk.)

43:51.864 --> 43:57.464
(Do it once you think of it.
No matter how difficult, never give up.)

43:59.304 --> 44:05.120
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

44:05.672 --> 44:11.200
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

44:12.712 --> 44:17.160
♪The world is too quiet♪

44:18.152 --> 44:25.080
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

44:25.992 --> 44:31.080
♪Who will visit me♪

44:32.136 --> 44:37.760
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

44:38.504 --> 44:41.560
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

44:41.800 --> 44:47.120
♪Into concern and care♪

44:52.648 --> 44:57.760
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

44:58.280 --> 45:04.120
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

45:05.576 --> 45:08.960
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

45:09.096 --> 45:15.320
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

45:15.816 --> 45:18.760
♪The lonely clock♪

45:18.920 --> 45:23.520
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

45:23.912 --> 45:27.160
♪Are we both♪

45:27.432 --> 45:30.960
♪Attracted to each other♪

45:32.104 --> 45:38.720
♪Falling into you♪

45:42.440 --> 45:48.240
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

45:49.096 --> 45:51.760
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

45:52.296 --> 45:56.920
♪From reaching eternity♪

45:57.320 --> 46:00.600
♪After rushing recklessly♪

46:00.808 --> 46:04.240
♪We approach each other♪

46:05.512 --> 46:09.120
♪Without turning back♪

46:10.504 --> 46:18.160
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

46:18.792 --> 46:25.280
♪Falling into you♪
